	{"AFAL mode (UNI2/MBTL D3D blend table, D3D_SetBlendModeFromTable):\n1 = normal (src alpha, inv src alpha)\n2 = additive (src alpha, one)\n3 = subtractive (reverse subtract, src alpha, one)\nNo AFAL = normal with the alpha forced to 255.", "AFAL モード (UNI2/MBTL の D3D ブレンドテーブル、D3D_SetBlendModeFromTable):\n1 = 通常 (src alpha、inv src alpha)\n2 = 加算 (src alpha、one)\n3 = 減算 (逆減算、src alpha、one)\nAFAL なし = アルファを 255 に固定した通常。"},
